*
!private/
!public/
!.gitignore

# Demo vendor source content is the seed source: ship it with the repo so
# `migrate:fresh --seed` works on a clean server. DemoVendorSeeder only
# creates the DB row; the actual feed source lives here as static files.
#
# Translations under storage/app/vendors/demo/translations/ are NOT tracked.
# They are regenerated by `php artisan feedai:backfill-translations` on each
# server, so tracking them creates merge conflicts whenever the LLM produces
# even slightly different output for the same source.
!vendors/
vendors/*
!vendors/demo/
vendors/demo/*
!vendors/demo/vendor.yaml
!vendors/demo/pages/
!vendors/demo/pages/**
!vendors/demo/content/
!vendors/demo/content/**
